    ("Write a Python function to find the factorial of a number.", "Here is a recursive version:\n\ndef factorial(n):\n    if n <= 1:\n        return 1\n    return n * factorial(n - 1)\n\nExample: factorial(5) returns 120."),
    ("Write a Python function to check if a word is a palindrome.", "A palindrome reads the same forward and backward:\n\ndef is_palindrome(word):\n    return word == word[::-1]\n\nExample: is_palindrome('radar') returns True."),
