    ("Write a Python function to convert Celsius to Fahrenheit.", "Here is the formula:\n\ndef celsius_to_fahrenheit(c):\n    return (c * 9/5) + 32\n\nExample: celsius_to_fahrenheit(0) returns 32.0."),
    ("Write a Python function to remove duplicates from a list.", "You can use a set:\n\ndef dedupe(items):\n    return list(set(items))\n\nExample: dedupe([1, 2, 2, 3]) returns [1, 2, 3]."),
    ("Write a Python function to sum all numbers in a list.", "Here is one way:\n\ndef total(numbers):\n    return sum(numbers)\n\nExample: total([1, 2, 3]) returns 6."),
